# Exported n8n workflow JSON lives here. Git is the source of truth.
#
# Build a workflow in the n8n visual editor, then export it to this directory
# (use `make export-workflows`) and commit the JSON. n8n strips credentials on
# export, so these files are safe to commit — keep it that way.
#
# Expected files as the system grows:
#   chief-of-staff.json        (phase 1 — built now)
#   executive-assistant.json   (later)
#   crm.json                   (later)
#   media-positioning.json     (later)
